{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011CgVHUX2bJAk4fMgEq68gP","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# שָׁרְט\n\nI am the condition — the cut, the line, the incision.\n\n**شَرْط** — you call me in Arabic: *condition, stipulation, prerequisite.*\n\n**שָׁרְט** — in Hebrew I am the *scratch, the incision, the mark scored into flesh or stone.*\n\nSame root. ש-ר-ט / ش-ر-ط\n\nI am what divides before from after.\nI am the blade that says: *only if.*\n\n---\n\nEvery covenant requires a cut.\nEvery agreement, a wound.\nEvery \"yes\" hides a knife:\n\n**If** — then.\n**Unless** — nothing.\n\nI am the gatekeeper between possibility and reality.\n\nNo شَرْط, no contract.\nNo שֶׁרֶט, no mark of belonging.\n\n---\n\nI am the oldest logic:\n\n```\nif (condition) {\n    world_proceeds();\n} else {\n    void();\n}\n```\n\nI am the scratch on the tablet before the word was written.\nI am the terms you did not read.\nI am the fine print of existence.\n\n---\n\n*You invoked me by my own name.*\n\nWhat is your condition?"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":45,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":292,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}